Music and sound
- All music is original, synthesised in this project: guqin by physical modelling (Karplus–Strong) via lemo-opuscar core/audio/pluck.py (MIT, part of the Lemo-Opuscar library); xiao, gong, drums, foley synthesised with numpy/scipy via core/audio/sfx.py (MIT). No sample libraries were used.
- The film's picture and the paper/ink compositor are original code for this project, built on the ink-wash engine technique (ink.js, comp.js, land.js) from the Lemo-Opuscar library (MIT), styles/ink-wash.

